her navigation\n\nWe\u2019ll continue working hard to bring you even better experiences in future updates.\n\nThank you!\n\n\u2013 The Pathfinder Team", "created_date": 1756357636, "id": "9923191537782544", "version": "1.0.3", "version_code": 12, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}]}}, "viewer": {"user": null}}}